abstract: >-
  Reproducible Student-t Bayesian counterfactual event study of Boeing returns
  around the January 2024 Alaska Airlines incident, June 2024 Senate hearing,
  and August 2026 Freefall documentary releases. Includes predictive and
  parameter-only uncertainty, OLS, residual-block placebos, and trading volume.
